{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-audio-fundamentals","title":"数字音频基础：采样率、位深与缓冲模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/digital-audio-fundamentals","wordCount":1400,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字音频基础-采样率-位深与缓冲模型\">数字音频基础：采样率、位深与缓冲模型</h1><p>数字音频是模拟声波的离散数学表示。理解采样率、位深、PCM 编码和缓冲延迟，是游戏音频编程的第一块基石——所有后续的 DSP 效果、空间渲染和混音操作都建立在这套数学基础之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>采样率（Sample Rate）</strong>：每秒对模拟信号采样的次数，决定可还原的最高频率（奈奎斯特定理）。游戏标准：48000 Hz。</li>\n<li><strong>位深（Bit Depth）</strong>：每个采样值的精度位数，决定动态范围。存储用 16-bit，运行时处理用 32-bit float。</li>\n<li><strong>音频缓冲（Audio Buffer）</strong>：硬件每次请求的固定大小 PCM 块，直接决定延迟。典型游戏设置 512 帧。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模拟到数字-采样定理\">模拟到数字：采样定理</h2><p>声音是空气压力随时间连续变化的物理波。数字音频通过<strong>采样</strong>将连续模拟信号转换为离散的数值序列。</p>\n<p><strong>奈奎斯特-香农采样定理</strong>：若采样率为 <code>fs</code>，则能够无失真重建的最高频率为 <code>fs/2</code>（奈奎斯特频率）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"模拟信号: ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~&#10;采样过程:  |   |   |   |   |&#10;数字样本: [0.3][0.7][0.9][0.4][0.1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>模拟信号: ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>采样过程:  |   |   |   |   |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>数字样本: [0.3][0.7][0.9][0.4][0.1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>人耳可听范围约 20Hz–20kHz，因此：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样率</th>\n<th>奈奎斯特频率</th>\n<th>常见用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>22050 Hz</td>\n<td>11025 Hz</td>\n<td>早期游戏音效、手机音频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>44100 Hz</td>\n<td>22050 Hz</td>\n<td>CD 标准、大多数游戏音效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>48000 Hz</td>\n<td>24000 Hz</td>\n<td>专业音频、视频同步、主机游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>96000 Hz</td>\n<td>48000 Hz</td>\n<td>高解析度录音制作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>游戏项目中 <strong>48000 Hz</strong> 是推荐标准，与视频帧率（24/60fps）有整数关系，避免采样率转换带来的质量损失和 CPU 开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位深与量化噪声\">位深与量化噪声</h2><p><strong>位深</strong>（Bit Depth）决定每个采样值可以表达的精度范围。<code>n</code> 位深对应 <code>2^n</code> 个离散幅度级别，产生的量化误差形成量化噪声。</p>\n<p>理论信噪比（SNR）公式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SNR(dB) = 6.02 × n + 1.76\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SNR(dB) = 6.02 × n + 1.76</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位深</th>\n<th>动态范围</th>\n<th>量化级数</th>\n<th>常见场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n<td>49.9 dB</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>复古音效、极低内存平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-bit</td>\n<td>98.1 dB</td>\n<td>65536</td>\n<td>CD 标准、大多数游戏资产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24-bit</td>\n<td>144.5 dB</td>\n<td>16777216</td>\n<td>录音棚母带、素材制作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32-bit float</td>\n<td>约 1528 dB（理论值受浮点精度限制）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>运行时音频处理，DSP 内部计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>重要实践</strong>：游戏音频资产通常存储为 16-bit PCM，但运行时 DSP 处理链内部使用 <strong>32-bit float</strong>。浮点格式在混音时不会因反复叠加产生累积量化误差。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[16-bit PCM 资产] --&gt; B[解码为 32-bit float]&#10;    B --&gt; C[DSP 处理链]&#10;    C --&gt; D[混音总线]&#10;    D --&gt; E[输出到硬件\\n16/24-bit]\">flowchart LR\n    A[16-bit PCM 资产] --&gt; B[解码为 32-bit float]\n    B --&gt; C[DSP 处理链]\n    C --&gt; D[混音总线]\n    D --&gt; E[输出到硬件\\n16/24-bit]</pre><h2 id=\"pcm-格式与交错布局\">PCM 格式与交错布局</h2><p><strong>脉冲编码调制</strong>（PCM）是最基础的音频存储格式，每个采样值直接存储为整数或浮点数，无压缩。</p>\n<p>多声道 PCM 数据有两种内存布局：</p>\n<p><strong>交错（Interleaved）</strong>：左右声道样本交替存储</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[L0][R0][L1][R1][L2][R2]...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[L0][R0][L1][R1][L2][R2]...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>平面（Planar/Non-interleaved）</strong>：声道连续存储</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[L0][L1][L2]...[R0][R1][R2]...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[L0][L1][L2]...[R0][R1][R2]...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>大多数音频硬件 API（XAudio2、AAudio）输入交错格式。DSP 处理库（如 FMOD 内部）倾向平面格式，因为 SIMD 运算对连续内存访问效率更高。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 交错格式转平面格式&#10;void deinterleave(const float* interleaved, float* left, float* right, int frames) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; frames; ++i) {&#10;        left[i]  = interleaved[i * 2];&#10;        right[i] = interleaved[i * 2 + 1];&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 交错格式转平面格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deinterleave</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> interleaved</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> frames</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frames; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left[i]  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interleaved[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interleaved[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓冲模型与音频延迟\">缓冲模型与音频延迟</h2><p>音频硬件不能逐样本请求数据，而是每次请求固定大小的<strong>音频缓冲块</strong>（Audio Buffer）。</p>\n<p><strong>缓冲大小</strong>（Buffer Size）直接决定音频延迟（Latency）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"延迟(ms) = 缓冲帧数 / 采样率 × 1000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>延迟(ms) = 缓冲帧数 / 采样率 × 1000</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以 48000 Hz 采样率为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓冲帧数</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>64 帧</td>\n<td>1.33 ms</td>\n<td>专业音频接口、实时演奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>256 帧</td>\n<td>5.33 ms</td>\n<td>高性能游戏（主机/PC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>512 帧</td>\n<td>10.67 ms</td>\n<td>常规游戏（感知边界约 10ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1024 帧</td>\n<td>21.33 ms</td>\n<td>移动端、Web 音频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4096 帧</td>\n<td>85.33 ms</td>\n<td>流式背景音乐可接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>双缓冲模型</strong>是标准实现：硬件播放缓冲 A 时，软件填充缓冲 B；播放完成后硬件切换到 B，软件填充 A。这避免了在硬件正在读取的缓冲区上写入（撕裂）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"class AudioBuffer {&#10;    static constexpr int FRAME_COUNT = 512;&#10;    static constexpr int CHANNEL_COUNT = 2;&#10;&#10;    float bufferA[FRAME_COUNT * CHANNEL_COUNT];&#10;    float bufferB[FRAME_COUNT * CHANNEL_COUNT];&#10;    std::atomic&lt;int&gt; activeBuffer{0};  // 0=硬件用A，1=硬件用B&#10;&#10;public:&#10;    float* getWriteBuffer() {&#10;        return activeBuffer.load() == 0 ? bufferB : bufferA;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    float* getReadBuffer() {&#10;        return activeBuffer.load() == 0 ? bufferA : bufferB;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    void swap() {&#10;        activeBuffer.store(1 - activeBuffer.load());&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FRAME_COUNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHANNEL_COUNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferA[FRAME_COUNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHANNEL_COUNT];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferB[FRAME_COUNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHANNEL_COUNT];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::atomic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activeBuffer{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 0=硬件用A，1=硬件用B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getWriteBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activeBuffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getReadBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activeBuffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bufferB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        activeBuffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activeBuffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"音频回调模型\">音频回调模型</h2><p>现代音频 API 采用<strong>回调（Callback）<strong>模型：硬件驱动在需要新缓冲数据时主动调用应用程序注册的回调函数。这个回调在独立的</strong>音频线程</strong>上运行，有严格的实时性要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// XAudio2 风格的回调&#10;class AudioCallback : public IXAudio2VoiceCallback {&#10;    void OnBufferEnd(void* pBufferContext) override {&#10;        // 硬件播放完一个缓冲，请求下一个&#10;        // 必须在极短时间内（&lt; 缓冲时长）返回&#10;        // 禁止: 锁、内存分配、文件IO、日志&#10;        AudioEngine::instance().onBufferRequest();&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// XAudio2 风格的回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> : </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IXAudio2VoiceCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OnBufferEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pBufferContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">override</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 硬件播放完一个缓冲，请求下一个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 必须在极短时间内（&#x3C; 缓冲时长）返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 禁止: 锁、内存分配、文件IO、日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        AudioEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBufferRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>音频回调的铁律</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>绝不在回调中分配/释放内存（malloc/free/new/delete）</li>\n<li>绝不在回调中等待互斥锁（可能死锁或产生延迟）</li>\n<li>绝不在回调中进行文件/网络 I/O</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"压缩格式-ogg-vorbis-与-adpcm\">压缩格式：Ogg/Vorbis 与 ADPCM</h2><p>原始 PCM 占用大量内存，游戏中常用压缩格式存储音频资产：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>CPU 解码开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PCM 16-bit</td>\n<td>1:1</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>短促音效、实时 DSP 输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADPCM</td>\n<td>约 4:1</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>旧平台、需要随机访问的音效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ogg Vorbis</td>\n<td>约 10:1</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>PC/主机背景音乐、长音效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AAC/MP4</td>\n<td>约 10:1</td>\n<td>低（硬件解码）</td>\n<td>iOS/Android 背景音乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Opus</td>\n<td>约 10:1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>现代跨平台推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>策略选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高频触发的短音效（脚步声、子弹）：PCM 或 ADPCM，预解码到内存</li>\n<li>背景音乐（BGM）：Ogg Vorbis / AAC，流式解码</li>\n<li>中等长度音效（爆炸声、环境音）：按目标平台预测内存预算决定</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数字音频编程建立在采样定理（奈奎斯特频率限制）、量化（位深与 SNR）、缓冲（延迟与双缓冲模型）三大支柱上。游戏中通常使用 48kHz/16-bit 存储资产，32-bit float 进行运行时处理，512 帧左右的缓冲大小平衡延迟与性能。音频回调模型要求严格的实时性纪律——回调内禁止任何阻塞操作。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"audio-engine-architecture\">音频引擎架构</a> — 在数字音频基础之上，Wwise/FMOD 如何组织整个音频子系统</li>\n<li><a href=\"audio-graph-and-mixing\">音频图与混音</a> — 多声源如何通过 Mixer Graph 混合、路由与处理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字音频基础：采样率、位深与缓冲模型","id":"数字音频基础-采样率-位深与缓冲模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模拟到数字：采样定理","id":"模拟到数字-采样定理"},{"level":2,"text":"位深与量化噪声","id":"位深与量化噪声"},{"level":2,"text":"PCM 格式与交错布局","id":"pcm-格式与交错布局"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲模型与音频延迟","id":"缓冲模型与音频延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"音频回调模型","id":"音频回调模型"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩格式：Ogg/Vorbis 与 ADPCM","id":"压缩格式-ogg-vorbis-与-adpcm"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"音频引擎架构：Wwise、FMOD 与 Audio Manager 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/audio-engine-architecture"}}